{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_intro_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6740fd61c4cc594ff9efa0fda5a8bda511926810228b1be9342ccf34618f8591", "ja": "（劇場の公演が近づいている。そろそろ、新しい\nユニットを考えないとな。コンセプトは……うーん）", "zh": "（剧场的公演快到了。也该考虑新的组合了。概念嘛……嗯——）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_intro_1001_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "5fc5afd5b15213041cbdec6f76e36cc1cb6698c48c9456750ab7c023a88a7e4f", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\nほっ……よかった～。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n呼……太好了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "4f48fd17477c393ed04ad50f710442c1089c3aacf1c5c34de8678786934efbb0", "ja": "お疲れさまです、青羽さん。\nどうかしたんですか？", "zh": "辛苦了，青羽小姐。\n怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "ab6fc944e6c9801813a85f1632ccf9dbb303961d21cb80b64db8632f3941e2e4", "ja": "はい！　{$P$}さんに用事があって、\n今から探しに行こうかと思ってたんです。", "zh": "是的！我有事要找{$P$}先生，正想着现在去找呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_intro_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "16ee1cc4e021f30057f981d4ad1cf5e7196c00b4f5d2f912407ed931a5951ad1", "ja": "探しに行ってたら、すれ違っちゃうとこでした！\n……あれ？　今日のネクタイ、素敵ですね♪", "zh": "要是我去找您的话，就差点和您错过了！\n……咦？您今天的领带真好看♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "466dc6abb54ab5578013aedac817cdb38730b58417af1c3c28fde0f5436f9b1f", "ja": "本当ですか？\n店員さんのオススメを買っただけなんですが……。", "zh": "真的吗？\n我只是买了店员推荐的款式……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "9853cb3072408c6db3a3a27cd2bf66434a8a601eb879e7426f2f8ffe143412a5", "ja": "センスのある店員さんですね！　……そうだ！\n今度、私にもネクタイを選ばせてくれませんか？", "zh": "真是位很有品位的店员呢！……对了！\n下次能不能也让我帮您挑选领带？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_intro_1008_p", "source_sha256": "f4689133d230498afd9bcb59d60cfe43ee728c01e7eb0cce6880420d6788faca", "ja": "いいんですか？　それは助かります！\nところで、用事っていうのは……？", "zh": "可以吗？那可真是帮大忙了！\n对了，您说的事情是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_intro_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "873def3b16bc3ed5be44c905737372510777a51d34d6523212180e210a6b70ed", "ja": "ああっ、そうでした！　社長さんからお電話があって、\n事務所にきてくれないかって。", "zh": "啊，对了！社长先生打来电话，说能不能请你来一趟事务所。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_intro_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "2a997a0c4e3e360e3a4c27b13d7db03673d4299f916a28af3ac0c7f839108c47", "ja": "なんでも、{$P$}さんに、\nとってもオシャレなお話があるとか……？", "zh": "听说，是关于{$P$}先生的，有件特别时髦的事要谈……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_intro_1011_p", "source_sha256": "b13daf6fce05a98534626a76787255e93847afb6c4f0588103a6536f5bbe7fba", "ja": "オシャレな話？　うーん、何のことだろう……\nとりあえず、事務所に行ってみますね！", "zh": "时髦的话题？嗯——到底是指什么呢……\n总之，我先去事务所看看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_intro_1012_102mis", "source_sha256": "c1993c2793920eccf3b1b171e4a074f06047a0dcff3a66b1052faedfcaed8f64", "ja": "はーい！\nお気をつけて、いってらっしゃーい♪", "zh": "好——！\n路上小心，慢走哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_intro_1013_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_intro_1014_president", "source_sha256": "20714ffc4d038bbfcfbf213333b54cf43f0a522181fddac90fd209595b9b25be", "ja": "やあ、君！　よく来てくれたね！\n……むむ？　そのネクタイ、なんだか珍しい柄だね？", "zh": "嗨，你来啦！真是欢迎你！\n……嗯嗯？你这条领带，图案好像挺少见的嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_intro_1015_101kot", "source_sha256": "001ed196fef4b4b8b62b75efe16aaa85120ef88d9cc49355fea08716474d2a81", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}さん！\n本当ですね？　とってもオシャレ！", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生！\n真的呢？特别时髦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_intro_1016_p", "source_sha256": "eedfc102cad206e8bbc3c7b2f0218c032215a953d7c0f04af4d68ad26fa0d3ab", "ja": "社長、音無さん、お疲れさまです。\nさっきも、青羽さんに褒めてもらったんです！", "zh": "社长、音无女士，辛苦了。\n刚才，青羽女士也夸过我了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_intro_1017_president", "source_sha256": "befbd94daed22f48215f529afec6fba38608e5d7b259baf7f5fc8ce1adb5daf3", "ja": "うむ……実にファッショナブル！　\n君によく似合っているよ。", "zh": "嗯……非常时尚！\n跟你很相配哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "b10f581ebb3742e054671da54bebd680f7baf55bd156c939d7ddae6634694152", "ja": "ところで……そんなファッショナブルな君に、\nファッショナブルな仕事の依頼があった！", "zh": "话说回来……有一份时尚的工作，想委托给这么时尚的你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_intro_1019_p", "source_sha256": "6e88d4df04a1adf4be27a0dcc0ab0259b7838bc3e7c1a8ea3057761acf4236d1", "ja": "いや、ファッショナブルだなんて照れる……え？\nファッショナブルな仕事の依頼、ですか？", "zh": "不，夸我时尚什么的，怪让人害羞的……诶？\n时尚工作的邀约，是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_intro_1020_president", "source_sha256": "d4d194c55f617b3268d5f89ec4c9702d2f73a7051b130bece249b8f4c59c43ce", "ja": "ああ。世界的に人気のあるファッション誌……\nその姉妹雑誌から、モデルのオファーが届いたんだよ。", "zh": "啊啊。那本享誉全球的时尚杂志……\n它的姐妹杂志发来了模特邀约。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_intro_1021_101kot", "source_sha256": "b32b6cb402affdff3d82f9c4844c54b147bab613d183717e1f3bb9d80014c45f", "ja": "確か『extra-mint-girl』ですよね？\n美希ちゃんがモデルをした時に、読んだ事があります！", "zh": "好像是《extra-mint-girl》对吧？\n美希做模特的时候，我读过那本杂志！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_intro_1022_president", "source_sha256": "024f5126e27eedf3f6d247c11a19b2dc352f1cb6779c832d3eeba62e2ad02625", "ja": "それだよ、音無君。先方の新企画に、佐竹美奈子君と\n横山奈緒君に、是非参加してほしいと言われてね。", "zh": "就是这个，音无。对方说，希望佐竹美奈子和\n横山奈绪能务必参加他们的新企划。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_intro_1023_p", "source_sha256": "6782f34d5bc57f32a9b485b9edf65b5b8c0598eae5ad3e6ea037ee564ddc101b", "ja": "美奈子と奈緒が、有名ファッション誌のモデルに……！\nこれは、大きなチャンスですね！", "zh": "美奈子和奈绪要成为知名时尚杂志的模特……！\n这可是个大好机会啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_intro_1024_president", "source_sha256": "0f6a7c3d68101e6164104689ab2ebacb3a6a7502dcd45155560fd23d43c8dce2", "ja": "うむ！　ふたりには、まずモデルとして誌面に登場し、\nその後、雑誌社主催のイベントにも出てもらう。", "zh": "嗯！先让两个人作为模特在杂志上亮相，\n之后还要参加由杂志社主办的活动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_intro_1025_p", "source_sha256": "499be0deac0cb0ebc1f87f5d72dbc9edde79ba95ae291c164e52e1de70ad591a", "ja": "えっ、もうイベントまで決まっているんですか！？\nすごいですね！", "zh": "诶，连活动都已经定下来了吗！？\n太厉害了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_intro_1026_president", "source_sha256": "9d9ee0665cfe634272017253c59a70dd1c4978cfa3e487f34a7290028f4b34f1", "ja": "ふふふ。\nこの企画は、それだけでは終わらないぞ？", "zh": "呵呵呵。\n这项企划还不止这些哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_intro_1027_p", "source_sha256": "2399a9fb0b8cd63097787d18736a9af88006592d0ef845e77f47afcc334ac328", "ja": "他にも、まだ何かあるんですか？", "zh": "其他的，还另有安排吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_intro_1028_president", "source_sha256": "62a859afe9645b29c3a237badadbf976ff313ab298cfac2593904a92009fc5f9", "ja": "この雑誌は毎月、誌面で人気投票を行うらしい。\nそこで、高い順位を取ることができれば……。", "zh": "据说这本杂志每月都会在杂志上进行人气投票。\n如果能在那里取得较高的名次……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_intro_1029_president", "source_sha256": "266d3d55fa248777b9e2505488ac7722fb8f43998fa1a8e8c444468faa1611de", "ja": "企画終了から、約1年間！　雑誌の誌面で、\nモデルとして活動してもらう事が確定するのだよ！", "zh": "企划结束后的约1年间！将确定让其在杂志上以模特身份开展活动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_intro_1030_p", "source_sha256": "8dd2743aef1def62838700a1193fca3a160bcc13c53dc1fe4b403f448c73b8c3", "ja": "1年も！？　今だけじゃなく、その先まで……。\n社長、なんとしても成功させたいです！", "zh": "整整1年！？不只是现在，连之后也……。\n社长，我无论如何都想让这次企划成功！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_intro_1031_president", "source_sha256": "4af1fb64f461891d1a3711c4b674a878475645ccc60dcf3dba377fec05225503", "ja": "うむ！　だが、毎月の人気投票は激戦だと聞いている。\n並大抵の努力では、太刀打ちできないかもしれないぞ？", "zh": "嗯！不过，听说每月的人气投票都竞争激烈。\n仅凭普通的努力，或许是无法抗衡的哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_intro_1032_p", "source_sha256": "04b613ac5163fdcf88e7ca3ffbdc2754b1c854edc46159140c4942fc305d777b", "ja": "うっ……確かに。十代の女の子は、流行に敏感です。\nもう一捻り、何かアイディアがほしいですね……。", "zh": "呃……确实。十几岁的女孩子对流行很敏感。\n还需要再多一点巧思，想个什么点子才好呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_intro_1033_101kot", "source_sha256": "e9816ccad6aca2806abf744fc6561f47d45795fd9126f2c54ba03d08d3177f66", "ja": "アイディアですか……うーん。まさか、劇場で\n大々的に雑誌を宣伝するわけにも行きませんし……。", "zh": "是指点子吗……嗯——总不能在剧场大张旗鼓地宣传杂志吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_intro_1034_p", "source_sha256": "d81d349e7c7a5e396c21ea79b6bd9e18fe2fcd2cd1fa05a53fa9181a20c6d967", "ja": "劇場で……そうか！　社長、美奈子と奈緒で、\n新しいユニットを組むというのはどうですか？", "zh": "在剧场……对了！社长，要不让美奈子和奈绪组建一个新组合？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_intro_1035_p", "source_sha256": "3c0c1a8d3cc0cc95fe906b21b8cccde9177d7e84c44d2991a6689f1511ee4428", "ja": "テーマは……トレンドを発信し続ける女子のカリスマ！\nファッションリーダーな存在というのはどうでしょう？", "zh": "主题是……不断引领潮流的女生偶像！\n打造时尚领袖般的存在，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_intro_1036_president", "source_sha256": "d78a4216a15f53807dd31def842ffa009feaeb835ef456ffc30f86614402353c", "ja": "ほほう！　なかなかいいテーマじゃないか！　よし、\nユニットのプロデュースと併せて、君に任せよう！", "zh": "哦哦！这主题相当不错嘛！好，就连同组合的制作一起交给你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_intro_1037_p", "source_sha256": "bc9d71b3975cc81a9f9b8d9ff98b91d6339339063d83d8d4c1248c6f8cf8c25b", "ja": "はいっ！　ありがとうございます！", "zh": "好的！谢谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_intro_1038_101kot", "source_sha256": "ed122978102bc506aec4489e7889b6614c598e2e824499d2ae4d1f63e3bc9963", "ja": "あの雑誌は、とにかくオシャレが命ですから……\n{$P$}さん、頑張ってくださいね！", "zh": "那本杂志不管怎么说，时尚感就是生命……\n{$P$}先生，要加油哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_intro_1039_p", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0123_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0123_story_intro_1040_p", "source_sha256": "127cab83ec1097277f2831bfdd63de651b9fdea55f525fc9865a9d855265b94e", "ja": "（雑誌にイベント出演、成功すれば大きな仕事になる。\nまずは……ふたりに、内容を伝えないとな！）", "zh": "（有个杂志活动的演出机会，要是成功了就能接到大工作。\n首先……得把内容告诉那两个人才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
